## 📌 Project Highlights

This project demonstrates the integration of:

**Computer Vision + Hand Tracking + 3D Graphics + Real-Time Interaction**

It provides an example of how webcam-based gesture recognition can be combined with a WebGL particle system to create an interactive browser experience.

